%% Experience Engine: stage state machine (UML state machine, informal)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending: run materialized (template vN pinned)
  Pending --> Available: anchor satisfied AND safety ok
  Pending --> SkippedByPlan: mode excludes stage
  Available --> InProgress: user opens
  Available --> SkippedByUser: user skips
  Available --> Deferred: user postpones / mode change
  Deferred --> Available: anchor re-satisfied
  InProgress --> Suspended: workout enters active_set or timed_interval
  Suspended --> InProgress: resting or finished
  InProgress --> Completed: criteria met (opened / acknowledged / completed_workout)
  Completed --> [*]
  SkippedByPlan --> Pending: replan includes stage
  note right of Completed
    Terminal. Replanning never changes it (FS-DWE-002).
  end note
  note right of Suspended
    No reading or typing during exertion (FS-DWE-003).
    Rest prompts only when resting with at least 20 s left.
  end note
